# Every knob at its limits on a loud sweep (echo ignores filter and resonance): the longest time, feedback 1.15,
# echoes only, then P1 0 (19.8 ms, metallic) and dry only (pan 0) must still pass sound.
tempo 120
steps 32
tail 0.5
track fx1
input sweep 30 16000 0.45
preset 255 255 0 0 255 0 0 0 0 255 255 255 0 0 0 0 0 0
gain 1
param p1 0 8
param pan 0 24
expect sound 0 32
expect peak_below 0
